Package: ou-gromox
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: mariadb-server | default-mysql-server, ou-gromox-php-mapi
Conflicts: gromox
Replaces: gromox
Provides: gromox (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Gromox groupware server (Office Unbound build)
 Gromox provides Exchange-compatible protocols (EWS, MAPI/HTTP, RPC/HTTP),
 IMAP/POP3 and mail delivery on top of a MariaDB/SQLite mailbox store.
 Built from the pinned upstream tag without vendor repositories. It contains
 no user cap or licence check. Services are installed but neither enabled
 nor started: configure the database first (gromox-dbop) and enable the
 units explicitly.

Package: ou-gromox-php-mapi
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ${php:Depends}, ou-gromox (= ${binary:Version})
Conflicts: gromox-php-mapi
Description: PHP MAPI extension for Gromox (Office Unbound build)
 php_mapi PHP extension used by the web, sync and dav front ends to talk to
 Gromox (zcore).
